-- expect-refusal: after the aggregate
-- examples/checks/agg-count-safety-4-refused-late-binder.rofl — C is shared
-- with the aggregate and bound only by a premise written after it, so
-- whether the count is asked per C or grouped by C would depend on where the
-- premise is written. The load door refuses it.
acs_late(C, N) :- N is count(B : acs_b(B, C)), acs_c(C).
